@PMS_HostAddress = http://localhost:5265

### List all watches (200 OK)
GET {{PMS_HostAddress}}/api/watches
Accept: application/json

### Get a watch by ID (200 OK, or 404 ProblemDetails)
GET {{PMS_HostAddress}}/api/watches/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a watch (201 Created with a Location header)
POST {{PMS_HostAddress}}/api/watches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Seiko",
  "model": "Presage",
  "price": 499.99,
  "stockQuantity": 8,
  "description": "Automatic dress watch with a cream dial."
}

### Replace a watch (204 No Content, or 404 ProblemDetails)
PUT {{PMS_HostAddress}}/api/watches/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Rolex",
  "model": "Datejust",
  "price": 8750.00,
  "stockQuantity": 2,
  "description": "Updated stock and price."
}

### Delete a watch (204 No Content, or 404 ProblemDetails)
DELETE {{PMS_HostAddress}}/api/watches/1
